      "content": "That's exactly the tone I was looking for. It really captures that sense of destiny. I want to lean even further into that theme of the frontier being a blank slate for greatness. Can you add a few more sentences that emphasize how this expansion was a natural and necessary step for the evolution of modern civilization?",
